          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493836512294-502baa1986e2?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Anxiety & Depression"/><strong>Anxiety & Depression</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584515933487-779824d29309?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Digestive Health"/><strong>Digestive Health</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535914254981-b5012eebbd15?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Heart Health"/><strong>Heart Health</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515377905703-c4788e51af15?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Menopause"/><strong>Menopause</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579684385127-1ef15d508118?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Type 2 Diabetes"/><strong>Type 2 Diabetes</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571731956672-f2b94d7dd0cb?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Weight Management"/><strong>Weight Management</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511174511562-5f7f18b874f8?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Sleep"/><strong>Sleep</strong></article>
          <article class="topic-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1477332552946-cfb384aeaf1c?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Nutrition"/><strong>Nutrition</strong></article>
