        <article class="card pillar"><h3>Reviewed by professionals</h3><p>Medical reviewers validate accuracy and context before publishing.</p></article>
        <article class="card pillar"><h3>Always up to date</h3><p>Articles are refreshed to reflect new evidence and evolving care standards.</p></article>
