        <p style="margin:0;color:var(--text-700);">Join thousands of readers who receive practical guidance, trend reports, and new tools each week.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <form id="newsletterForm">
          <input type="email" id="emailInput" placeholder="Enter your email" required aria-label="Email address" />
